Today is Sunday.
It is very dark outside.
Heavy rain is falling.
This is the June monsoon season.
The rainwater beats against my window.
I make a cup of coffee.
I come near the window.
This coffee is very hot.
I drink the coffee slowly.
I look at that calendar on the wall.
This month is almost over.
I came to Kochi five months ago.
There was no rain here back then.
I remember that time.
I look outside again.
Those trees are swaying in the wind.
I don't have to go to the office today.
Therefore, I am in no hurry at all.
